---
const consent = Astro.cookies.get('analytics_consent')?.value;
const hasChoice = consent === 'granted' || consent === 'denied';
---

<footer class="mb-6 text-sm text-skin-base/70">
  <button type="button" data-analytics-preferences class="underline underline-offset-4 cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4" hidden>Analytics preferences</button>
</footer>
<section data-analytics-banner hidden={hasChoice} aria-labelledby="analytics-heading" class="fixed bottom-4 left-4 right-4 z-50 mx-auto max-w-2xl rounded-xl border border-skin-base/20 bg-skin-fill p-5 shadow-lg">
  <h2 id="analytics-heading" class="font-semibold">Optional analytics</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm">With your permission, Google Analytics helps me understand visits and traffic sources. It uses analytics cookies and sends usage data to Google. It stays off until you accept. Your choice is saved for six months and can be changed using Analytics preferences in the footer.</p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm"><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-skin-accent underline underline-offset-4">Google's privacy policy ↗</a></p>
  <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
    <button type="button" data-analytics-choice="denied" class="rounded-lg border border-skin-base/30 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer hover:bg-skin-base/5 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4">Reject analytics</button>
    <button type="button" data-analytics-choice="granted" class="rounded-lg border border-skin-base/30 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer hover:bg-skin-base/5 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4">Accept analytics</button>
  </div>
  <noscript><p class="mt-3 text-sm">JavaScript is disabled, so analytics is not loaded.</p></noscript>
</section>
<script>
  import '../lib/analytics';
</script>
